+// COSMOS STRUCTURES P1b (docs/COSMOS-STRUCTURES-DESIGN.md §12.4/§12.6) -- the procedural VILLAGE generator
+// constants + salts, a VERBATIM mirror of structure_gen.gd (StructureGen). Its _hash01 is a verbatim copy of
